# ============================================================
# uploads/README
#
# This folder stores résumé files uploaded by job seekers.
#
# File organisation (to implement in application_service.py):
#   uploads/
#     resumes/
#       user_<id>_<uuid>.pdf    ← one PDF per application
#
# SECURITY NOTES:
#   - Always use werkzeug.utils.secure_filename() before saving uploads
#     to prevent directory traversal attacks.
#   - Validate file extension (.pdf only) before saving.
#   - Consider setting a max file size (already configured in config.py).
#   - In production, store files in cloud storage (e.g., AWS S3, Google Cloud)
#     rather than the local filesystem.
#
# This directory is intentionally kept in git with just this README.
# Actual uploaded files are excluded via .gitignore.
# ============================================================
